cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use circDEX, please cite it as below."
title: "circDEX: an automated Snakemake workflow for circular RNA detection, differential expression and biomarker prioritization"
abstract: >-
  circDEX is a containerized Snakemake workflow for circRNA analysis.
  Detection combines CIRIquant and DCC into a weighted confidence score from
  coordinate agreement and junction-read support. Forward-splice junction
  counts enter an edgeR model as an offset, so differential expression is
  assessed relative to local linear transcript abundance and classified into
  three types. DESeq2 and limma-voom run in parallel as FSJ-independent
  references. The workflow also provides isoform-switching analysis,
  six-dimensional biomarker prioritization, miRNA and RBP interaction
  prediction, and an interactive web interface that produces a
  self-contained HTML report.
